cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the article below."
title: "WP-M2 Net: Wavelet-Perception Macro-Micro Dynamic 1D-CNN for Efficient Sequential Motion Recognition from Sparse sEMG"
abstract: >-
  WP-M2 Net is a lightweight four-stage 1D convolutional network for sequential motion
  recognition from sparse surface electromyography. Each stage couples a frozen
  Daubechies-4 wavelet macro-perception branch with a grouped short-kernel micro-aggregation
  branch, capturing both the slow envelope of a movement sequence and its transient bursts.
